# ProgramCreator — Cursor Rules (v2)

## Business
- Brand: ProgramCreator | Founder: Daive (@daivescales) | Service: Creator Product Scaling
- Lane A (creators/digital): build product or convert store page. Payment: REVENUE SPLIT, zero upfront.
- Lane B (physical brands): storefront rebuild + social→site. Payment: MONTHLY RETAINER.
- Same discipline both lanes; payment model is the only structural difference — say it plainly.
- Audience: smart 22–35 creators/founders from Daive's socials. Allergic to agency fluff.

## Voice
Confident, direct, unhurried. Short declarative sentences. Specific beats clever.
Banned: unlock, elevate, empower, synergy, revolutionize, seamless, cutting-edge, game-changer, "in today's landscape", "we're passionate about", "let's take it to the next level".
No exclamation marks. No emoji in UI. Understatement over hype.

## Visual — dark editorial
- Mid-navy page, white type, one bright accent used sparingly. Enormous whitespace. Oversized display type. Near-square radius (4px). Numbered sections (01)–(06).
- NOT: purple, neon, glassmorphism, heavy shadows, stock office photos, emoji, rounded-everything, decorative gradients.

### Tokens (exact)
--pc-navy-900 #071528 · --pc-navy-800 #0B2038 (page bg) · --pc-navy-700 #102C4C · --pc-navy-600 #16395F · --pc-navy-500 #1E4B7A
--pc-line rgba(255,255,255,0.09) · --pc-line-2 rgba(255,255,255,0.16)
--pc-white #FFFFFF · --pc-text #C2D4E8 · --pc-muted #7E97B4 (lighten to #94AAC4 if AA fails at small sizes)
--pc-accent #4D9BFF · --pc-accent-2 #A9CDFF · --pc-glow rgba(77,155,255,0.30)

### Type
- Inter Tight 400/500/600/700 — structural; headings tracking-[-0.035em]
- Instrument Serif italic 400 ONLY — 1–2 emphasis words in display headings, colour --pc-accent-2. ~5 uses total. Never body/buttons.
- display clamp(3rem,9vw,8rem) leading-[0.92] tracking-[-0.04em]
- h2 clamp(2.25rem,5.5vw,4.5rem) · h3 clamp(1.25rem,2vw,1.65rem) · body 17–19px leading-[1.65] max-w-[62ch]
- meta 12px uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-pc-muted

### Surfaces & texture
- Cards: bg-navy-700, 1px --pc-line, radius 4px, p-8–p-10. Elevation via border/bg lift, not shadow.
- Section sep: full-width 1px --pc-line rules.
- Grain: fixed feTurbulence overlay ~3.5% opacity sitewide.
- Aurora: soft --pc-glow blooms behind hero + final CTA only (barely visible).
- Optional 1px hero grid at 3% opacity, fade down.

### Section numbering
Eyebrow row: "(01)" in accent · hairline that expands 0→100% on entry · uppercase 12px muted label right. Numbers 01–06.

## Motion (engineered, not busy)
Libs: framer-motion, gsap+ScrollTrigger, lenis (lerp 0.09, synced to GSAP ticker).
Ease in: cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1) · out: cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)
Durations: micro 180ms · standard 600ms · display 900ms.

Primitives in src/components/motion/: MaskText (word mask, signature), MaskLines, CharDrift, Reveal, ScrollScale, Parallax (±0.3 max), CountUp, Marquee, MagneticButton, ScrambleText (nav/footer only), StickyStack (Process pin).

Global: IntroLoader once/session · CustomCursor pointer:fine only · ScrollProgress 2px accent top · section rule expand.
prefers-reduced-motion: no Lenis, no intro, no cursor, reveals = 0.2s opacity only. Text always in DOM for no-JS.

If busy: cut ScrambleText first, then custom cursor. Keep MaskText.

## Funnel
Routes: / · /apply · /book · /privacy · /terms
Every CTA → /apply (never Cal.com). Labels: "Apply to work with me" / "See the process".
/apply → Supabase + Sheet + Resend → /book (Cal embed).

## Tech
Next 15 App Router, TS strict, Tailwind, Framer Motion, GSAP, Lenis, lucide-react only.
Server Components default; motion as leaf client components.
Config only in src/lib/site-config.ts. No lorem. No stock people photos.
Mobile-first 375/768/1440. AA contrast. focus-visible --pc-accent rings.
Intentional TODOs only: results data, Daive photo.
